  "deviations": [
    "No frozen statistical parameter, input artifact, or model setting changed. An initial no-fit attempt exposed AnnData view behavior: a custom per-cell Jacobian stored in uns was not automatically subset when an old donor was dropped. The X05-only script now explicitly carries the existing retained-cell Jacobians into the masked view; the same A03 arguments and stored values were then run.",
